{"data": [{"author_id": "19355829", "created_at": "2026-11-01T19:35:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116977455160299962"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Jonathan's Space Report | Current Issue", "display_url": "planet4589.org/jsr.html", "end": 68, "expanded_url": "https://planet4589.org/jsr.html", "start": 45, "status": 200, "title": "Jonathan's Space Report - Latest Issue", "unwound_url": "https://planet4589.org/jsr.html", "url": "https://t.co/6gKV8Gl53V"}]}, "id": "2116977455160299962", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3091, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Jonathan's Space Report No. 861 published at https://t.co/6gKV8Gl53V", "url": "https://x.com/planet4589/status/2116977455160299962"}, {"author_id": "610659001", "created_at": "2026-11-01T19:26:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116975137497199079"], "id": "2116975137497199079", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 37, "impression_count": 17735, "like_count": 415, "quote_count": 14, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 78}, "text": "Demanding economic growth has become unfashionable among some people in Europe.\n\nInstead they speak of a “cost of living crisis”.\n\nBut it’s really one and the same.\n\nEconomic growth means that incomes rise relative to prices.\n\nEconomic growth means that the things we need become", "url": "https://x.com/MaxCRoser/status/2116975137497199079"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:48:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116890048712856028"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/richardhanania…", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/richardhanania/status/2116499628262596967", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/HFUcL4MtQX"}]}, "id": "2116890048712856028", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 26, "impression_count": 11158, "like_count": 133, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116499628262596967", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Perhaps a simpler explanation for “why now” is in recent years affirmative action by race has been largely dismantled and white elites *and their kids* have experienced an actual *reduction* in fortunes as a result because Asians are so dominant. This is why tons of the https://t.co/HFUcL4MtQX", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116890048712856028"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:44:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116889213756981469"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/elonbachman/st…", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/elonbachman/status/2116820473514213804", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/htl1Xq99O3"}]}, "id": "2116889213756981469", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 3144, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116820473514213804", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "When you look at this graph, you may see “evidence of persistent elitehood”\n\nOr you may see “putatively similar measures of elitehood yield massively different trends and levels of elitehood”\n\nIf you see the second, you have more neurons firing than if you see the first https://t.co/htl1Xq99O3", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116889213756981469"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:43:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116888792044847394"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/bitpaine/statu…", "end": 154, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/bitpaine/status/2116613053185962422", "start": 131, "url": "https://t.co/8msiMhXJF7"}]}, "id": "2116888792044847394", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 5343, "like_count": 223, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116613053185962422", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Woah woah woah\n\nYou’re telling me the state can make citizens safe\n\nJust by exercising a monopoly on force?!?!?\n\nAmaze amaze amaze https://t.co/8msiMhXJF7", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116888792044847394"}, {"author_id": "21436960", "created_at": "2026-11-01T10:05:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116833879159980385"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "You have already liked this page, you can only like it once! October was a month of discoveries and milestones. ESA’s Rosalind Franklin rover team trained in Spain’s desert, preparing for Mars. Our Smile mission captured the full ring of northern lights around Earth, while Mars Express uncovered new clues about a giant Martian cloud. ESA astronaut Sophie Adenot returned to Earth after 237 days in space, and Hera captured its first images of the asteroids it will study to help protect our planet. Meanwhile,", "display_url": "esa.int/ESA_Multimedia…", "end": 112, "expanded_url": "https://esa.int/ESA_Multimedia/Videos/2026/10/What_happened_this_month_at_the_European_Space_Agency_October_2026", "start": 89, "status": 200, "title": "What happened this month at the European Space Agency? (October 2026)", "unwound_url": "https://www.esa.int/ESA_Multimedia/Videos/2026/10/What_happened_this_month_at_the_European_Space_Agency_October_2026", "url": "https://t.co/aVY53qQI8E"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/c2J34mR5C7", "end": 136, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2116833879159980385/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116199684628680705", "start": 113, "url": "https://t.co/c2J34mR5C7"}]}, "id": "2116833879159980385", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 15346, "like_count": 122, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 22}, "text": "October was a busy month! Here’s your monthly roundup from the European Space Agency.\n\n🔗 https://t.co/aVY53qQI8E https://t.co/c2J34mR5C7", "url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2116833879159980385"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-01T01:17:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116701227660816410"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jenniferdoleac…", "end": 126, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jenniferdoleac/status/2116645660099563980", "start": 103, "url": "https://t.co/gdG8n65azu"}]}, "id": "2116701227660816410", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 4783, "like_count": 127, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116645660099563980", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I think this basically tells us banning phones at school is a good idea even though it isn’t a panacea https://t.co/gdG8n65azu", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116701227660816410"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:59:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116636229504823514"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/lillybilly299/…", "end": 44, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lillybilly299/status/2116544731614212158", "start": 21, "url": "https://t.co/0ssJqgYAhp"}]}, "id": "2116636229504823514", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 94, "impression_count": 105562, "like_count": 4752, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 43}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116544731614212158", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "It’s called “a meal” https://t.co/0ssJqgYAhp", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116636229504823514"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:31:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116583968812441699"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/danitreweek/st…", "end": 150, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/danitreweek/status/2116510999662739593", "start": 127, "url": "https://t.co/TZEhCAgEK4"}]}, "id": "2116583968812441699", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4621, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116510999662739593", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Dani believes it is persecution of Christian singles that bigger cereal boxes are cheaper per ounce than smaller cereal boxes. https://t.co/TZEhCAgEK4", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116583968812441699"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:25:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116491842577674522"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/lizisamused/st…", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lizisamused/status/2115982415659499785", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/R8OmXRNCSH"}]}, "id": "2116491842577674522", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 39, "impression_count": 9314, "like_count": 276, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 11}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115982415659499785", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "At the individual level, earlier sex probably doesn’t reduce male investment, true\n\nAt the societal level, a norm of earlier sex absolutely 1,000% for sure reduces male investment\n\nRight conduct consists in acting in a way which values the latter more than the former https://t.co/R8OmXRNCSH", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116491842577674522"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:00:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116485397832458639"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/col_a_buendia/…", "end": 41, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/col_a_buendia/status/2116341304355385848", "start": 18, "url": "https://t.co/WYvw3lq2EV"}]}, "id": "2116485397832458639", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3028, "like_count": 67, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116341304355385848", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I mean, not wrong https://t.co/WYvw3lq2EV", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2116485397832458639"}, {"author_id": "19355829", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:33:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116478735134155251"], "id": "2116478735134155251", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 11229, "like_count": 178, "quote_cou